### Table Definition (`public.accounts`)
| Column | Type | Constraints | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `account_id` | `VARCHAR(64)` | `PRIMARY KEY` | Unique account ID (e.g., `TXN-xxxxxxxxxxxx`) |
| `customer_id` | `VARCHAR(64)` | `NOT NULL` | Associated customer id |
| `account_type` | `VARCHAR(20)` | `CHECK IN ('SAVINGS', 'CHECK', 'CREDIT')` | Type of accounts |
| `balance` | `NUMERIC(15, 2)` | `NOT NULL` | Account balance |
| `currency` | `VARCHAR(3)` | `NOT NULL DEFAULT 'AUD'` | Currency ISO code |
| `status` | `VARCHAR(20)` | `CHECK IN ('ACTIVE', 'INACTIVE')` | Account status |

### ACE ODBC Runtime Configuration

1. In `/var/mqsi/odbc/odbc.ini` (or `$ODBCINI`):
```ini
[ODBC Data Sources]
MY_PG_DSN=PostgreSQL Wire Protocol

[MY_PG_DSN]
Driver=/opt/ibm/ace-12.0.12.0/server/ODBC/drivers/lib/UKsqls95.so
Description=IBM App Connect Enterprise PostgreSQL Wire Protocol
Database=banking_db
HostName=localhost
PortNumber=5432
LogonID=postgres
Password=secret
```

2. Register credentials with the ACE Integration Node:
```bash
mqsisetdbparms <IntegrationNodeName> -n odbc::MY_PG_DSN -u postgres -p secret
mqsicvp <IntegrationNodeName> -n MY_PG_DSN
```

